X:1
T:Tears in Heaven
C:Eric Clapton
M:4/4
O:UK, 1992
N:First verse (two lines) and the "I must be strong" bridge. Melody from the "Melody" channel of a karaoke MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 16434), cross-checked against two other arrangements (tracks 85628 and 352641010881239): the pitches agree. Moved down from A major to F major so the lowest note lands on C4. Where the arrangements differ by a sixteenth, the karaoke rhythm was followed in the verse and the majority rhythm in the bridge, plus the leading tone before "carry on" (F-sharp in this key) that the karaoke channel lacks. Left out: the sixteenth-note pickups into "name", grace notes and runs, the later verses and the guitar solo. Chords from the arrangement's guitar and pad channels.
